WEBVTT

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:11.040
Ever since the demon king abducted the princess,

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:15.410
the fight between demons
and humans has intensified.

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:22.410
The demon forces deployed to all the lands
were stationed on rotation to prevent burnout.

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:28.120
Open the gate!

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:35.740
What? Oh, shoot! <i>They're</i> back now?

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:42.620
Goodbye, peace and quiet.

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:49.080
--Welcome back!
--You've returned!

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:53.330
The female unit has returned!

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:56.080
It's good. Now the princess
will have people to talk to.

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:59.910
Yeah, that's true.
She's probably a little lonely.

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:06.290
Now, time to search for
a way to sleep well tonight.

00:01:06.490 --> 00:01:07.990
Indifferent

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:13.040
Right. It'd be nice to have
a different comforter.

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:15.660
All right, I'll head out to find one now.

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:19.520
"Quest"

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:19.520
"New Comforter"

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:27.290
Wow! This is the only place
that doesn't reek of males!

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:05.040
"Fifth Night"

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:05.040
"The Princess and Female Warriors"

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:09.950
U-Um...

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:12.990
U-Um...

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:17.160
E-Excuse me...

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:18.490
M-My name's Harpy.

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:26.980
Harpy

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:20.490
M-My name's Harpy.

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:22.870
My unit returned from deployment today.

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:27.370
Um, I'm interested in human culture,
so I'd love to chat with you.

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:30.040
Can I make it from anything in my room?

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:33.200
Oh, just hear me out, please!

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:34.660
E-Excuse me...

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:39.870
<i>No response. Like talking to a corpse.</i>

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:43.700
I'd like the comforter to be about this big.
On the smaller side.

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:45.870
She can't have that little interest in me!

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:55.870
No, it's okay! Human girls will
definitely take the bait with this topic.

00:03:55.870 --> 00:03:59.790
Yes, I'll entice her with girl talk!

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.450
Princess!

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:05.620
Princess, do you like anyon--

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:06.620
Annoying.

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:11.290
H-Her reaction...

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:15.290
She's just too embarrassed!

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:20.290
Which means, she must have a crush on someone!

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:25.200
Is it a noble hero?!
Or forbidden love with a demon?!

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.620
Which is it of the two?!

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:33.040
Wall of rejection

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:37.080
O-Oh, come on, Princess. I won't tell a soul.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:40.120
Hm? You seem to be having fun here.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:46.310
Demon King has appeared!

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:43.450
Demon King!

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:46.290
Thanks for keeping the princess company.

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:50.040
Might as well talk inside, yeah?

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:51.290
O-Okay!

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:56.080
<i>Demon King sent out Harpy and departed!</i>

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:03.070
<i>What will the princess do?</i>

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:03.070
<i>Fight</i>

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:00.580
<i>Item</i>

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:00.580
<i>Run</i>

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:03.070
<i>Item</i>

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:03.070
<i>Run</i>

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:02.080
<i>Sleep</i>

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:03.070
<i>Scratch</i>

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:02.080
<i>Slap</i>

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:02.080
<i>Scissor Guillotine</i>

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:03.070
<i>Sleep</i>

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:03.070
<i>Slap</i>

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:03.070
<i>Scissor Guillotine</i>

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:06.330
Princess's special
Quilladillo needle glove

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:06.330
You're getting between me and my new comforter.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:08.790
No!

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:09.460
<i>Harpy takes 200 damage</i>

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:14.450
Now, I can finally go find
materials for my comforter--

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:17.200
Please, wait!

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:21.540
You... You don't like me
because I'm a demon, huh?

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:33.200
But, please. It's always been
my dream to have fun girl talk

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:37.200
or have a pajama party
with friends like human girls.

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:39.740
Though I'm a demon...

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:45.450
She's the first human girl I've ever talked to.

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:50.950
...I want to become friends with you!

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:58.330
Feathery wings

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:06.950
Say, do these wings come off?

00:06:06.950 --> 00:06:09.160
Huh? No, they don't...

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:14.370
I guess they wouldn't. And forcing them off
would ruin these gorgeous feathers.

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:16.870
They feel so soft.

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:21.490
As smooth as silk with just
the right amount of weight.

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:27.660
On top of that, they're the perfect size
for the season. Not too large.

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:30.330
How can I make these my comforter?

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:37.410
You. Me. Friends.

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:39.410
You really mean it?!

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:41.870
Th-Then let's have some girl talk--

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:42.670
And now...

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:46.330
We will now have a pajama party.

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:49.370
Yay!

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:54.490
U-Um, Princess. What about girl talk?

00:06:54.490 --> 00:06:56.870
Shh. Be quiet.

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:59.370
Er, can I face that way?

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:00.410
Nope.

00:07:03.490 --> 00:07:06.160
What wonderful bedding.

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:11.200
<i>This</i> is a real feather comforter.

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:14.660
Zzz...

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:24.210
Quest Complete

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:23.910
Found a feathery friend of a comforter!

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:35.580
This is definitely <i>not</i> a pajama party!

00:07:36.980 --> 00:07:41.980
"Harpy"

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:39.660
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:52.120
Why? Why must I be injured so?

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:55.950
It's this Demon Castle's fault.

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:59.580
It's because the Demon Castle's
beds are too narrow.

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:05.830
It's definitely because of your sleep posture.

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:09.080
I want... a bigger bed!

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:12.760
"Quest"

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:12.760
"A Bigger Bed"

00:08:13.580 --> 00:08:18.080
You see? So do you know of a suitable material?

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:23.490
H-Huh? The princess is asking me for help?!

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:32.040
Oh, the Forest Area has monster
bird nests that might work!

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:33.870
The branches are nice and brittle...

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:38.120
She's clearly disappointed!

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:44.490
U-Um... There's also a cool rock
slab in the Rock Area...

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:48.950
She had that look on her face
the moment I said "rock"!

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:52.200
Oh, I see. That's why.

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:55.450
Humans aren't interested in branches or rocks!

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:58.490
Extent of human words:
girl talk, pajama party

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:01.330
At this rate, I won't be able
to give her any good ideas!

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:05.330
Uh... What else? What else?

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:06.910
A good bed...

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:08.580
A good bed!

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:16.490
I know! How about a napping spot that
was popular among winged demons?

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:22.240
We'd sleep atop the castle's symbol, the horns.

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:27.580
It's actually magically solidified
cloud to keep it lightweight.

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:28.700
Cloud.

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:34.240
Yes! It was so soft that it became
too popular and they banned us--

00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:40.080
Exactly what I need.

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:44.080
Oh, no! I just spilled a castle secret!

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:47.040
I was so happy the princess seemed
interested that it slipped out!

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:51.660
Prepping

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:51.660
Oh, b-but you can't go!

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:55.240
Its high altitude is dangerous for humans.

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:58.450
Dangerous? Though you're accompanying me?

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:08.800
"Friend Gauge"

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:03.700
What? She's relying on me?

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:07.950
The princess... is relying on <i>me</i> ?!

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:11.910
Th-Then, how will we get--

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:14.370
Good.

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:20.200
Go.

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:25.190
Mental image

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:21.580
Go.

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:25.700
I've definitely seen this way of flying before!

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:31.870
Um, hang on. If you're going
to sit between my legs...

00:10:31.870 --> 00:10:32.870
Yeah.

00:10:32.870 --> 00:10:36.490
...you want me to fly with my legs apart?

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:37.490
Yeah.

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:40.200
My quads are going to die.

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:48.830
All right!

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:50.540
We're taking off!

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:10.290
Demon Castle Topmost Area - Sky Horns

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:15.740
I thought my legs would get
ripped out of their sockets.

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:19.790
Wh-What do you think, Princess? Pretty nice--

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.330
Lying down already!

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:25.660
P-Princess, how is it?

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:37.290
She probably doesn't actually
think of me as a friend.

00:11:41.580 --> 00:11:44.410
But I was so desperate...

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:47.910
I wasn't supposed to tell her about this place!

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:54.830
This spot I was lying on was soft. It's good!

00:11:57.120 --> 00:12:00.540
Don't, Princess!
The demon king directly supervises this--

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:04.080
Oh, no!

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:07.990
P-Princess!
Please make due with just napping here!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:13.330
And that chunk is way too big for just a bed!

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:18.370
Huh? But it's for you to sleep on with me.

00:12:18.370 --> 00:12:19.870
What?

00:12:19.870 --> 00:12:23.120
Huh? Then this was all for me?

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:26.240
Image of
cramped bed

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:31.270
"Friend Gauge"

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:30.200
You took such a large piece for <i>me</i> ?

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:37.490
Princess! We really are friends!

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:38.580
Wait, hey!

00:12:41.870 --> 00:12:47.120
I've acquired a large and
delightfully fluffy new bed.

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:50.200
And the comforter is ready.

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:51.200
Now...

00:12:54.240 --> 00:13:00.790
...to fall into magnificent sleep
cocooned in cloud and feathers.

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:06.450
With a bed so large, I won't slide off anymore.

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:08.660
These feathers stay in place, too.

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:14.410
What a gentle... sleep...

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:17.040
Zzz...

00:13:18.070 --> 00:13:25.280
Quest Complete

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:24.870
Well done!

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:29.370
I'm friends with the princess!

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:44.700
Why does a portion of
the castle's horns look so foolish?!

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:46.330
Who did this?!

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:47.990
--Please calm yourself, Demon King!
--Happiness!

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:49.330
How can--

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:50.040
Princess!

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:54.520
Since then, Harpy
comes on a daily basis

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:52.370
It's me again!

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:54.700
No afternoon nap today?

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:57.330
Feel free to invite me anytime!

00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:01.490
I'm returning this.

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:02.540
What?!

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:10.040
"Minotaur"

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:07.950
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:23.540
The heroes, whose beloved princess
is imprisoned at the Demon Castle,

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:27.580
fight endless battles with demons.

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:31.410
At last, a ray of hope comes
shining through the darkness.

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:38.990
This is the final blow!

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:52.240
Heroes...

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:58.790
Looks like the Sand Dragon,
one of the big ten, has been defeated.

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:07.390
Big Ten Council

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:07.830
So you heroes aren't constantly
being crushed, huh?

00:15:07.830 --> 00:15:08.830
Intriguing.

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:13.770
Poseidon

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:12.700
I want to fight next.

00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:18.400
Fire Venom Dragon

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:16.370
You think you can do it?

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:18.790
I'll fight first.

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:23.400
Neo Alraune

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:22.330
I'm rather excited to fight with the hero.

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:26.700
We decided the order long ago.

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:30.290
It's customary to go from weakest to strongest.

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:36.200
And in the event that you displease
the demon king by rushing out there.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.990
You know what will happen?

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:43.580
You'd better be prepared
for severe punishment to follow.

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:44.870
Stop that noise!

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:48.300
Enchanting Vuvuzela (souvenir)

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:57.120
Good grief, what's wrong with you?
Honking like crazy while we have our meeting.

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:59.370
Changing instruments doesn't help!

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:01.330
You don't need to honk between my sentences!

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:05.620
Princess, we're having an
important meeting at the moment.

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:08.830
That's right. What are you doing here, anyway?

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:10.240
I was bored.

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:11.120
What?

00:16:11.120 --> 00:16:16.370
I recently realized that I don't sleep
well on days I don't do anything.

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:18.790
Isn't that just lack of exercise?!

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:21.120
You can't be here no matter the reason. Get out!

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:31.450
H-Her expression just now...

00:16:36.330 --> 00:16:43.370
When I see her like that,
it reminds me that she is a captive here.

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:48.240
Demon King, let us continue.

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:50.040
I-I will commence--

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:51.040
That...

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:54.950
That poor princess!

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:58.580
What?

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:01.990
Do you know what deeds she's done?!

00:17:01.990 --> 00:17:04.580
I have heard.

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:08.370
But what does it matter?

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:10.540
Abducted in her sleep...

00:17:10.510 --> 00:17:19.640
Abductor

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:13.620
Abruptly torn apart from her family...

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:15.540
Demon King!

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:17.910
And now all alone here at the Demon Castle.

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:19.120
Demon King!

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:21.370
One should turn a blind eye to some degree.

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:26.700
Could it be that you are rather narrow-minded?

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:30.620
Oh?

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:33.080
I see.

00:17:33.080 --> 00:17:37.290
Oh? Oh, yeah, Alraune?

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:39.490
Is that what you think?

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:42.200
Ah.

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:43.910
I see now.

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:46.290
Put it on.

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:47.330
At once!

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:55.140
Evil Flower Garden

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:57.910
We're seeing from a surveillance
item we have on the princess.

00:17:57.910 --> 00:18:01.040
The female unit was absent for quite some time.

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:03.330
Take this chance to watch closely.

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:07.370
See if you still feel sorry for
the princess after viewing this!

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:10.450
Why of course I will.

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:23.580
Oh?

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:26.830
Elder brother

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:26.830
Younger sister

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:33.660
Um, isn't that my elder brother?

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:36.410
What is she doing--

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:39.120
She's making a log bed.

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:40.790
Log bed?

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:45.450
It's been five days now.

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:52.830
Hm... Is it just my imagination,
or is my brother smaller?

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:55.200
He is.

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:57.870
Take a look at my pompadour.

00:18:57.870 --> 00:19:01.490
You can see the marks where
she's chopped at every day.

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:03.240
The princess is quite diligent.

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:08.870
Um, and those markings on his back...

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:12.260
Sya

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:11.580
Did she carve her name?

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:15.490
Yeah. Probably to mark it as her property.

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:18.830
Still with us?

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:23.040
Huh? U-Um, yes... right.

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:24.080
Hm?

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:32.240
Well, <i>all</i> demons are responsible
for abducting the princess...

00:19:32.240 --> 00:19:33.370
You're trying really hard.

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:38.870
Er, what is she doing now?

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:38.870
I'll kill you!

00:19:38.870 --> 00:19:42.740
Right. She must be trying
to hollow the trunk out.

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:45.080
Hollow out?

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:46.490
To finish in one go!

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:48.290
She probably got tired of hacking.

00:19:50.740 --> 00:19:53.950
Wait! How much? How much is she hollowing out?!

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:05.330
Epic!

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:31.540
<i>The princess acquired premium wood!</i>

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:29.080
Full combo!

00:20:33.990 --> 00:20:38.370
I feel so pure right now for some reason.

00:20:38.370 --> 00:20:41.330
Forget pure, you're completely hollow.

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:44.160
Well, what do you think?

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:55.040
As a tree, my brother shouldn't feel pain.

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:57.120
Is that the issue here?

00:20:57.120 --> 00:21:02.910
A-And if she uses it all,
you could say it's eco-friendly--

00:21:02.910 --> 00:21:04.450
All but this one are too rough.

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:11.200
Yeah.

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:13.830
Yes, everything is fine now!

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:16.080
Yes, that poor princess!

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:18.870
Don't avert your gaze from reality!

00:21:18.870 --> 00:21:20.870
See? Look closely.

00:21:24.990 --> 00:21:28.950
It was worth the days it took me
to put notches into the wood.

00:21:28.950 --> 00:21:34.990
Nevertheless, I would make
a log bed again someday.

00:21:34.990 --> 00:21:38.410
It was great, since it was good exercise, too.

00:21:40.490 --> 00:21:41.950
Zzz...

00:21:43.990 --> 00:21:46.540
That there is a human princess.

00:21:46.540 --> 00:21:49.830
Doesn't she look so happy when she sleeps?

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:53.160
But she's still a captive... despite everything.

00:21:54.870 --> 00:21:56.870
Next
Day

00:22:01.330 --> 00:22:03.330
Princess?

00:22:03.330 --> 00:22:06.450
Are you truly a human being?

00:22:06.450 --> 00:22:07.580
Who are you?

00:22:08.060 --> 00:22:10.560
Anyway, she 
apologized to the demons

00:23:42.790 --> 00:23:47.830
I've heard that a nap after dinner
is silver--before dinner, golden.

00:23:47.830 --> 00:23:51.790
I see. But I want to sleep at all times.

00:23:51.790 --> 00:23:54.700
Next time, "The Princess' Unwavering Choice."

00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:56.290
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .
